START

Initialize V(s) = 0 for all states

Set learning rate α
Set discount factor γ

FOR each game episode:

    Initialize current state S

    WHILE game is not over:

        Observe reward R
        Observe next state S'

        Calculate TD Target:
            Target = R + γ × V(S')

        Update state value:
            V(S) = V(S) + α ×
                   [Target - V(S)]

        Set:
            S = S'

    END WHILE

END FOR

Display final state-value estimates

STOP
